{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-039.md","record_count":45,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்தம்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...தம்பீ! இந்த தாசி அன்னமா வேஷம் போட்டாளே, அவ யாரு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதைப்பத்தி சந்தேகப்பட்டுத்தான் நான் ஒங்ககிட்ட கேட்டுப் போகலாம்னு வந்தேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உங்களுக்கும் சந்தேகம்தானா? அதுதான் எல்லோருக்கும் தெரிஞ்சுபோச்சே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...நம்ப சமரசம் அவர்களுக்கும், அந்தப் பெண்ணுக்கும் ஏதாவது உண்டுங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உண்டு...உண்டு...உண்டு...அதையேன் இப்படி பயந்துகிட்டு ஒளிவு மறைவா கேக்குறீங்க?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லை...மொதல்ல அந்தப் பெண்ணுக்கும் உங்க வீட்டுக்கும் ஒரு தொடர்பும் இருக்காதுன்னு நெனைச்சேன். இப்ப பார்க்கும்போது, அந்தப் பெண்ணும் நம்ப சமரசம் அவர்களும் அந்தப் பெண்ணு வீட்டுக்குள்ளே சேர்ந்தாப்பிலே போனதை நான் பார்த்தேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"போனாங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சேந்தாப்பிலே போனாங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமா, பாத்துட்டுதான் வர்ரேன்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உங்க கண்ணாலே பாத்தீங்களா தம்பீ?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராசா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாம்மா.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தம்பீ, சொல்ரேன்னு நீங்க வருத்தப்பட்டுக்காதீங்க. ஊருக்கெல்லாம் உபதேசம் பண்றாரு. இவரு இப்படி எல்லாம் நடக்கலாமா? இவரை நான் எவ்வளவோ நம்பியிருந்தேன் தம்பீ, நீங்கதான் என்கூட பொறந்த பொறப்பு மாதிரி...உங்ககிட்ட சொல்றதுக்கு என்ன? அவரை எப்படியாவது திருத்திடுங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":56,"printed_page":55}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நீங்க என்ன சொல்றீங்க?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அதுதான் தம்பி. இந்த நாடகக்காரியோடெ சேர்ந்துகிட்டு இந்த வயசிலே இப்படியெல்லாம் சுத்துவாங்களா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ. நீங்க அப்படி சந்தேகப்பட்டுட்டீங்களா? அதெல்லாம் ஒண்ணும் நெனைக்காதீங்கம்மா.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நான் தான் கண்ணுலே பார்க்கிறேனே தம்பீ! அவ தினம் தினம் தோட்டத்துக்கு வந்துபோறாளே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கண்ணால் கண்டதும் பொய்—காதால் கேட்டதும் பொய்—தீர விசாரிப்பதே மெய்யம்மா.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒன்ஸ்மோர்....","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சார்...வணக்கம் சார்....","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வணக்கம் ஒன்சுமோர்....","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னா சார் ஒங்களுக்குத் தெரியாத சார்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எனக்குத் தெரியும்; இன்னொருத்தருக்கு தெரிய வேண்டி இருக்கு.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...வேணாம் சார்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சொல்லுன்னு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ...சரி சார்...கண்ணால் கண்டதும் பொய்—காதால் கேட்டதும் பொய்—தீர விசாரிப்பதே மெய். சார்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சபாஷ்...சபாஷ்....","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சபாஷ்...சபாஷ்....","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கண்ணால் கண்டதெல்லாம் மெய்தான். ஒண்ணும் பொய்யில்லே. நீங்க வாங்க, நாம பேசுவோம்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"ராஜா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அம்மா...நான் வர்ரேம்மா....அப்ப சார் நான் வர்ரேன் சார்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஏய், எங்க பொறப்பட்டே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வேலையெல்லாம் முடிஞ்சிபோச்சிங்க...சும்மா இப்படி வெளியேபோயி படுக்கலாம்னு பொறப்பட்டேனுங்க.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d033","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முருகா....","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d034","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யா.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d035","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வந்து, அன்னைக்கு அந்த சேலை அவன் வாங்கி கொடுத்தான்னு சொன்னியே...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d036","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆமாங்க...அவனே தான் வாங்கி கொடுத்தான், இதில் என்னாங்க சந்தேகம்? அவன்தான் வாங்கி கொடுத்தான்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d037","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னடா இது, முன்னுக்கு பின் முரணாயிகிட்டே போவது?...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":57,"printed_page":56}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d038","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னாங்க...நீங்க மொரனுன்று சொல்றீங்க! இந்த பயல்தான்...நம்ப சங்கரன் பயதான் வாங்கிக் கொடுத்தானுங்க...நான் என் கண்ணால பாத்தேனே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":58,"printed_page":57}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d039","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சங்கரன் பய வாங்கி யாருக்கு கொடுத்தான்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":58,"printed_page":57}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d040","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அவளுக்கு கொடுத்துட்டான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":58,"printed_page":57}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d041","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எவளுக்கு...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":58,"printed_page":57}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d042","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நம்ப வேலைக்காரிக்கு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":58,"printed_page":57}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d043","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நாசமாபோச்சு! அந்த சேலை சங்கதியைபத்தித்தானா நீ சொன்னே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":58,"printed_page":57}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d044","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சமை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பின்ன, நீங்க வேறெ எதைப்பத்தி சொல்றீங்க...நீங்க?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":58,"printed_page":57}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s039-d045","scene_id":"raja-rani-s039","scene_ordinal":39,"transition_audit_id":"T039","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஒண்ணுமில்லேப்பா! நீ போய் படுத்து தூங்குபோ அப்பா! சந்தேகம் ஒரு பெரிய வியாதிதான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":58,"printed_page":57}],"source_scene_file":"scene-039.md"}]}